# The built console (agent_plane/console/dist) and its source HTML shell get
# checked out with CRLF on Windows (core.autocrlf) and Vite's HTML transform
# carries whatever line endings the source already has straight into the
# output - so a Windows checkout can bake CRLF into a build that's otherwise
# byte-identical to CI's Linux one, and the "committed bundle is current"
# check in CI (which always builds on Linux, always LF) sees a false diff.
# Force LF for both regardless of the checkout platform.
console/index.html text eol=lf
agent_plane/console/dist/index.html text eol=lf
